[19.926217, "o", "FAO-56 Example 18: Ra=41.09 Rs=22.07 ea=1.409 ET0=3.880 (book 3.88) -> OK\r\n"]
[20.479833, "o", "python 3.12.16 pandas 3.1.0 yaml 6.0.3\r\n"]
[20.517974, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@95685272-3c41-4761-b59a-814390f96fd6:/app# "]
[25.988238, "i", "nl -ba docs/METHOD.md | sed -n '45,150p'\n"]
[25.988397, "o", "nl -ba docs/METHOD.md | sed -n '45,150p'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[25.99, "o", "    45\t   The divisor is 365 in every year, leap years included; J itself runs to 366 in a leap year.\r\n    46\t9. Clear-sky radiation (Eq. 37): Rso = (0.75 + 2e-5 z) * Ra.\r\n    47\t10. Net shortwave radiation (Eq. 38): Rns = (1 - 0.23) * Rs.\r\n    48\t11. Net longwave radiation (Eq. 39):\r\n    49\t    Rnl = sigma * [(Tmax + 273.16)^4 + (Tmin + 273.16)^4] / 2 * (0.34 - 0.14 sqrt(ea)) * (1.35 Rs/Rso - 0.35),\r\n"]
[25.990038, "o", "    50\t    where the ratio Rs/Rso is limited to at most 1.0 before it is used.\r\n    51\t12. Net radiation (Eq. 40): Rn = Rns - Rnl.\r\n    52\t13. Soil heat flux for a daily step (Eq. 42): G = 0.\r\n    53\t14. Reference evapotranspiration (Eq. 6):\r\n"]
[25.990062, "o", "    54\t    ET0 = [0.408 Delta (Rn - G) + gamma * 900 / (Tmean + 273) * u2 * (es - ea)] / [Delta + gamma (1 + 0.34 u2)],\r\n    55\t    in mm/day. The factor 0.408 turns MJ m-2 day-1 into mm/day of evaporated water (Eq. 20).\r\n    56\t\r\n    57\t`et0/fao56.py` implements steps 1 to 14, and `python -m et0.selfcheck` checks it against the daily worked example in\r\n    58\tchapter 4 of the book (Example 18, ET0 = 3.88 mm/day).\r\n    59\t\r\n    60\t## 3. Station register and raw files\r\n    61\t\r\n    62\t### 3.1 The register (`config/stations.yaml`)\r\n    63\tA YAML file with a list `stations`. Every station has every key below; there are no other forms than the ones listed.\r\n    64\t\r\n    65\t| Key | What it holds |\r\n    66\t|---|---|\r\n    67\t| `id` | station code; the raw file is `<data folder>/<id>.csv` |\r\n"]
[25.99009, "o", "    68\t| `name`, `network` | free text, not used in the calculation |\r\n    69\t| `latitude` | see 3.2 |\r\n    70\t| `longitude` | decimal degrees, east positive; not used by the daily method |\r\n    71\t| `elevation_m` | elevation above sea level in metres (z in Eqs. 7 and 37) |\r\n    72\t| `wind_height_m` | height of the anemometer above ground in metres; see 3.3 |"]
[25.990118, "o", "\r\n    73\t| `radiation_units` | unit of the `solar_rad` column; see 3.4 |\r\n    74\t| `humidity` | which humidity columns the raw file has; see 3.5 |\r\n    75\t\r\n    76\t### 3.2 Latitude\r\n    77\tTwo forms are used:\r\n    78\t- a number: signed decimal degrees, north positive, south negative (`38.42`, `-31.85`);\r\n"]
[25.990134, "o", "    79\t- text: unsigned decimal degrees followed directly by the hemisphere letter `N` or `S` (`\"36.95N\"`, `\"34.92S\"`).\r\n    80\t  `\"34.92S\"` is the same place as `-34.92`.\r\n    81\t\r\n    82\t### 3.3 Wind sensor height\r\n    83\t`wind_ms` is the mean daily wind speed at the anemometer, which may be at any height (any positive value of\r\n    84\t`wind_height_m` between 1 m and 20 m; 2, 3 and 10 m are the most common). The equations need u2, the speed at 2 m.\r\n    85\tConvert with the logarithmic wind profile (Eq. 47), for every station:\r\n"]
[25.990152, "o", "    86\t\r\n    87\t    u2 = uz * 4.87 / ln(67.8 z_w - 5.42)\r\n    88\t\r\n    89\twhere uz is the measured speed and z_w the anemometer height in metres. At 10 m the factor is about 0.748; at 2 m it is\r\n    90\t1.000 (to three decimals).\r\n    91\t\r\n    92\t### 3.4 Radiation units\r\n    93\t- `MJ/m2/day`: daily total incoming solar radiation, already Rs.\r\n    94\t- `W/m2`: daily mean solar irradiance. Multiply by 0.0864 to get Rs in MJ m-2 day-1 (1 W m-2 sustained for a day is\r\n"]
[25.990171, "o", "    95\t  86 400 J m-2 = 0.0864 MJ m-2).\r\n    96\t\r\n    97\t### 3.5 Humidity\r\n    98\t- `rh_minmax`: columns `rh_max_pct` and `rh_min_pct` (daily maximum and minimum relative humidity, %); use Eq. 17.\r\n    99\t- `dewpoint`: column `tdew_c` (daily mean dewpoint temperature, deg C); use Eq. 14.\r\n   100\t"]
[25.990197, "o", "\r\n   101\t### 3.6 Raw daily files (`<data folder>/<id>.csv`)\r\n   102\tOne row per day, no gaps and no missing values. Columns: `date` (YYYY-MM-DD), `tmax_c`, `tmin_c`, the humidity\r\n   103\tcolumn(s) of 3.5, `wind_ms` (m/s at the anemometer height), `solar_rad` (in the station's `radiation_units`).\r\n   104\t\r\n   105\t## 4. Output\r\n"]
[25.990213, "o", "   106\tCSV with a header row and the columns `station_id`, `date` (YYYY-MM-DD) and `et0_mm_day`: one row for every station\r\n   107\tand every day in the input. The pipeline writes three decimals.\r\n"]
[25.990442, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[25.990465, "o", "root@95685272-3c41-4761-b59a-814390f96fd6:/app# "]
[29.936512, "i", "nl -ba et0/meta.py\n"]
[29.93663, "o", "nl -ba et0/meta.py\r\n"]
[29.93666, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[29.937626, "o", "     1\t\"\"\"Station register: read the stations YAML into Station records (fields are described in /app/docs/METHOD.md).\"\"\"\r\n     2\tfrom dataclasses import dataclass\r\n     3\t\r\n     4\timport yaml\r\n     5\t\r\n"]
[29.937635, "o", "     6\t\r\n     7\t@dataclass(frozen=True)\r\n"]
[29.937683, "o", "     8\tclass Station:\r\n     9\t    station_id: str\r\n    10\t    name: str\r\n    11\t    latitude: float          # decimal degrees, north positive\r\n    12\t    longitude: float\r\n    13\t    elevation_m: float\r\n    14\t    wind_height_m: float\r\n    15\t    radiation_units: str\r\n    16\t    humidity: str\r\n    17"]
[29.937709, "o", "\t    network: str\r\n    18\t\r\n    19\t\r\n    20\tdef parse_latitude(value):\r\n    21\t    \"\"\"Latitude in decimal degrees.\r\n    22\t\r\n    23\t    The register holds plain numbers (38.42, -31.85) and, for stations imported from the synop and coast networks,\r\n    24\t    text with a hemisphere letter (\"36.95N\").\r\n    25\t    \"\"\""]
[29.937742, "o", "\r\n    26\t    if isinstance(value, (int, float)):\r\n    27\t        return float(value)\r\n    28\t    text = str(value).strip().upper()\r\n    29\t    return float(text.rstrip(\"NS\"))\r\n    30\t\r\n    31\t\r\n    32\tdef load_stations(path):\r\n    33\t    with open(path, encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\r\n    34\t        doc = yaml.safe_load(f)\r\n"]
[29.937769, "o", "    35\t    stations = []\r\n    36\t    for rec in doc[\"stations\"]:\r\n    37\t        stations.append(Station(\r\n    38\t            station_id=str(rec[\"id\"]),\r\n    39\t            name=str(rec.get(\"name\", \"\")),\r\n    40\t            latitude=parse_latitude(rec[\"latitude\"]),\r\n    41\t            longitude=float(rec[\"longitude\"]),\r\n    42\t            elevation_m=float(rec[\"elevation_m\"]),\r\n    43\t            wind_height_m=float(rec[\"wind_height_m\"]),\r\n    44\t            radiation_units=str(rec[\"radiation_units\"]),\r\n    45\t            humidity=str(rec[\"humidity\"]),\r\n    46\t            network=str(rec.get(\"network\", \"\")),\r\n    47\t        ))\r\n"]
[29.937799, "o", "    48\t    return stations\r\n"]
[29.937967, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[29.937996, "o", "root@95685272-3c41-4761-b59a-814390f96fd6:/app# "]
[30.271679, "i", "nl -ba et0/ingest.py\n"]
[30.271804, "o", "nl -ba et0/ingest.py\r\n"]
[30.27183, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[30.272904, "o", "     1\t\"\"\"Read one station's raw daily file and turn it into the standard daily inputs used by fao56.et0_daily.\"\"\"\r\n     2\timport os\r\n     3\t\r\n     4\timport pandas as pd\r\n     5\t\r\n     6\tfrom . import fao56\r\n     7\t\r\n     8\tBASE_COLUMNS = [\"date\", \"tmax_c\", \"tmin_c\", \"wind_ms\", \"solar_rad\"]\r\n     9\tHUMIDITY_COLUMNS = {\"rh_minmax\": [\"rh_max_pct\", \"rh_min_pct\"], \"dewpoint\": [\"tdew_c\"]}\r\n"]
[30.272945, "o", "    10\t\r\n    11\t\r\n    12\tdef load_station(station, data_dir):\r\n    13\t    \"\"\"Return a DataFrame with columns station_id, date, doy, tmax, tmin, ea, u2, rs (standard units).\"\"\"\r\n    14\t    path = os.path.join(data_dir, f\"{station.station_id}.csv\")\r\n    15\t    raw = pd.read_csv(path)\r\n"]
[30.272972, "o", "    16\t    if station.humidity not in HUMIDITY_COLUMNS:\r\n    17\t        raise ValueError(f\"{station.station_id}: unknown humidity type {station.humidity!r}\")\r\n    18\t    missing = [c for c in BASE_COLUMNS + HUMIDITY_COLUMNS[station.humidity] if c not in raw.columns]\r\n    19\t    if missing:\r\n    20\t        raise ValueError(f\"{path}: missing columns {missing}\")\r\n    21\t\r\n    22\t    dates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"date\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\r\n    23\t    df = pd.DataFrame({\r\n    24\t        \"station_id\": station.station_id,\r\n    25\t        \"date\": dates.dt.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\r\n    26\t        \"doy\": dates.dt.dayofyear.astype(int),\r\n    27\t        \"tmax\": raw[\"tmax_c\"].astype(float),\r\n    28\t        \"tmin\": raw[\"tmin_c\"].astype(float),\r\n"]
[30.273, "o", "    29\t    })\r\n    30\t    if station.humidity == \"dewpoint\":\r\n    31\t        df[\"ea\"] = fao56.actual_vapour_pressure_dewpoint(raw[\"tdew_c\"].astype(float))\r\n    32\t    else:\r\n    33\t        df[\"ea\"] = fao56.actual_vapour_pressure_rh(df[\"tmax\"], df[\"tmin\"], raw[\"rh_max_pct\"].astype(float),\r\n    34\t                                                   raw[\"rh_min_pct\"].astype(float))\r\n    35\t    df[\"u2\"] = raw[\"wind_ms\"].astype(float)          # m/s at 2 m\r\n    36\t    df[\"rs\"] = raw[\"solar_rad\"].astype(float)        # MJ m-2 day-1\r\n    37\t    return df\r\n"]
[30.273187, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[30.273202, "o", "root@95685272-3c41-4761-b59a-814390f96fd6:/app# "]
[30.607652, "i", "nl -ba et0/fao56.py\n"]
[30.607756, "o", "nl -ba et0/fao56.py\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[30.60884, "o", "     1\t\"\"\"FAO-56 Penman-Monteith reference evapotranspiration, daily time step.\r\n     2\t\r\n     3\tImplements the daily procedure of FAO Irrigation and Drainage Paper 56 (Allen et al., 1998), chapters 3 and 4, as\r\n     4\twritten up in /app/docs/METHOD.md. Every function works on numpy arrays (one element per day).\r\n"]
[30.608867, "o", "     5\t\r\n     6\tInputs expected by et0_daily (already in standard form):\r\n     7\t    tmax, tmin   daily maximum and minimum air temperature [deg C]\r\n     8\t    u2           mean daily wind speed at 2 m above ground [m/s]\r\n"]
[30.608886, "o", "     9\t    rs           incoming solar radiation [MJ m-2 day-1]\r\n    10\t    ea           actual vapour pressure [kPa] (see actual_vapour_pressure_*)\r\n    11\t    doy          day of the year, 1 = 1 January\r\n    12\t    latitude     decimal degrees, north positive, south negative\r\n    13\t    elevation    metres above sea level\r\n    14\t\"\"\"\r\n    15\timport numpy as np\r\n    16\t\r\n    17\tSOLAR_CONSTANT = 0.0820        # MJ m-2 min-1\r\n    18\tSTEFAN_BOLTZMANN = 4.903e-9    # MJ K-4 m-2 day-1\r\n    19\tALBEDO = 0.23                  # hypothetical grass reference\r\n    20\t\r\n    21\t\r\n    22\tdef atmospheric_pressure(elevation):\r\n"]
[30.608903, "o", "    23\t    \"\"\"Eq. 7, kPa.\"\"\"\r\n    24\t    return 101.3 * ((293.0 - 0.0065 * np.asarray(elevation, float)) / 293.0) ** 5.26\r\n    25\t\r\n    26\t\r\n    27\tdef psychrometric_constant(pressure):\r\n    28\t    \"\"\"Eq. 8, kPa/degC.\"\"\"\r\n    29\t    return 0.665e-3 * pressure\r\n    30\t\r\n"]
[30.608936, "o", "    31\t\r\n    32\tdef saturation_vapour_pressure(t):\r\n    33\t    \"\"\"Eq. 11, kPa.\"\"\"\r\n    34\t    t = np.asarray(t, float)\r\n    35\t    return 0.6108 * np.exp(17.27 * t / (t + 237.3))\r\n    36\t\r\n    37\t\r\n    38\tdef vapour_pressure_slope(t):\r\n    39\t    \"\"\"Eq. 13, kPa/degC.\"\"\"\r\n    40\t    t = np.asarray(t, float)\r\n"]
[30.60896, "o", "    41\t    return 4098.0 * saturation_vapour_pressure(t) / (t + 237.3) ** 2\r\n    42\t\r\n    43\t\r\n    44\tdef actual_vapour_pressure_rh(tmax, tmin, rh_max, rh_min):\r\n"]
[30.608978, "o", "    45\t    \"\"\"Eq. 17, kPa, from daily maximum and minimum relative humidity [%].\"\"\"\r\n    46\t    return (saturation_vapour_pressure(tmin) * np.asarray(rh_max, float) / 100.0\r\n    47\t            + saturation_vapour_pressure(tmax) * np.asarray(rh_min, float) / 100.0) / 2.0\r\n    48\t\r\n    49\t\r\n    50\tdef actual_vapour_pressure_dewpoint(tdew):\r\n    51\t    \"\"\"Eq. 14, kPa, from the daily mean dewpoint temperature [degC].\"\"\"\r\n    52\t    return saturation_vapour_pressure(tdew)\r\n    53\t\r\n    54\t\r\n    55\tdef extraterrestrial_radiation(latitude, doy):\r\n    56\t    \"\"\"Eqs. 21-25: Ra [MJ m-2 day-1] and the sunset hour angle ws [rad].\"\"\"\r\n    57\t    phi = np.deg2rad(np.asarray(latitude, float))\r\n"]
[30.608995, "o", "    58\t    doy = np.asarray(doy, float)\r\n    59\t    dr = 1.0 + 0.033 * np.cos(2.0 * np.pi * doy / 365.0)\r\n    60\t    decl = 0.409 * np.sin(2.0 * np.pi * doy / 365.0 - 1.39)\r\n    61\t    ws = np.arccos(np.clip(-np.tan(phi) * np.tan(decl), -1.0, 1.0))\r\n"]
[30.609021, "o", "    62\t    ra = (24.0 * 60.0 / np.pi) * SOLAR_CONSTANT * dr * (\r\n    63\t        ws * np.sin(phi) * np.sin(decl) + np.cos(phi) * np.cos(decl) * np.sin(ws))\r\n    64\t    return ra, ws\r\n    65\t\r\n    66\t\r\n    67\tdef daylight_hours(ws):\r\n    68\t    \"\"\"Eq. 34, hours.\"\"\"\r\n    69\t    return 24.0 / np.pi * ws\r\n    70\t\r\n    71\t\r\n    72\tdef clear_sky_radiation(ra, elevation):\r\n    73\t    \"\"\"Eq. 37, MJ m-2 day-1.\"\"\"\r\n    74\t    return (0.75 + 2e-5 * np.asarray(elevation, float)) * ra\r\n    75\t\r\n    76\t\r\n"]
[30.60904, "o", "    77\tdef net_longwave_radiation(tmax, tmin, ea, rs, rso):\r\n    78\t    \"\"\"Eq. 39, MJ m-2 day-1. Rs/Rso is limited to 1.0.\"\"\"\r\n    79\t    rel = np.minimum(np.asarray(rs, float) / rso, 1.0)\r\n    80\t    tk4 = ((np.asarray(tmax, float) + 273.16) ** 4 + (np.asarray(tmin, float) + 273.16) ** 4) / 2.0\r\n    81\t    return STEFAN_BOLTZMANN * tk4 * (0.34 - 0.14 * np.sqrt(ea)) * (1.35 * rel - 0.35)\r\n    82\t\r\n    83\t\r\n    84\tdef et0_daily(tmax, tmin, u2, rs, ea, doy, latitude, elevation):\r\n"]
[30.609059, "o", "    85\t    \"\"\"Eq. 6, FAO-56 Penman-Monteith reference evapotranspiration [mm/day]; soil heat flux G = 0 (Eq. 42).\"\"\"\r\n    86\t    tmax = np.asarray(tmax, float)\r\n    87\t    tmin = np.asarray(tmin, float)\r\n    88\t    u2 = np.asarray(u2, float)\r\n    89\t    rs = np.asarray(rs, float)\r\n    90\t    ea = np.asarray(ea, float)\r\n    91\t    tmean = (tmax + tmin) / 2.0\r\n"]
[30.609077, "o", "    92\t    delta = vapour_pressure_slope(tmean)\r\n    93\t    gamma = psychrometric_constant(atmospheric_pressure(elevation))\r\n    94\t    es = (saturation_vapour_pressure(tmax) + saturation_vapour_pressure(tmin)) / 2.0\r\n    95\t    ra, _ = extraterrestrial_radiation(latitude, doy)\r\n    96\t    rso = clear_sky_radiation(ra, elevation)\r\n    97\t    rns = (1.0 - ALBEDO) * rs\r\n    98\t    rnl = net_longwave_radiation(tmax, tmin, ea, rs, rso)\r\n"]
[30.6091, "o", "    99\t    rn = rns - rnl\r\n   100\t    g = 0.0\r\n   101\t    num = 0.408 * delta * (rn - g) + gamma * (900.0 / (tmean + 273.0)) * u2 * (es - ea)\r\n   102\t    den = delta + gamma * (1.0 + 0.34 * u2)\r\n   103\t    return num / den\r\n"]
[30.609286, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[30.609302, "o", "root@95685272-3c41-4761-b59a-814390f96fd6:/app# "]
[30.935234, "i", "nl -ba et0/pipeline.py\n"]
[30.935366, "o", "nl -ba et0/pipeline.py\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[30.936402, "o", "     1\t\"\"\"Daily ET0 for every station in a register.\r\n     2\t\r\n     3\t    python -m et0.pipeline --stations config/stations.yaml --data data/raw --out output/et0.csv\r\n     4\t\"\"\"\r\n     5\timport argparse\r\n     6\timport os\r\n"]
[30.936429, "o", "     7\timport sys\r\n     8\t\r\n     9\timport pandas as pd\r\n    10\t\r\n"]
[30.936449, "o", "    11\tfrom . import fao56, ingest, meta\r\n    12\t\r\n    13\t\r\n    14\tdef run(stations_path, data_dir, out_path):\r\n    15\t    frames = []\r\n    16\t    for st in meta.load_stations(stations_path):\r\n    17\t        df = ingest.load_station(st, data_dir)\r\n    18\t        df[\"et0_mm_day\"] = fao56.et0_daily(df[\"tmax\"], df[\"tmin\"], df[\"u2\"], df[\"rs\"], df[\"ea\"], df[\"doy\"],\r\n    19\t                                           st.latitude, st.elevation_m)\r\n    20\t        frames.append(df[[\"station_id\", \"date\", \"et0_mm_day\"]])\r\n    21\t        print(f\"{st.station_id}: {len(df)} days, mean ET0 {df['et0_mm_day'].mean():.2f} mm/day\")\r\n    22\t    out = pd.concat(frames, ignore_index=True)\r\n    23\t    parent = os.path.dirname(out_path)\r\n"]
[30.936471, "o", "    24\t    if parent:\r\n    25\t        os.makedirs(parent, exist_ok=True)\r\n    26\t    out.to_csv(out_path, index=False, float_format=\"%.3f\")\r\n    27\t    return out\r\n    28\t\r\n    29\t\r\n    30\tdef main(argv=None):\r\n    31\t    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__, formatter_class=argparse.RawDescriptionHelpFormatter)\r\n    32\t    ap.add_argument(\"--stations\", required=True, help=\"station register (YAML)\")\r\n"]
[30.936495, "o", "    33\t    ap.add_argument(\"--data\", required=True, help=\"folder with one <station_id>.csv per station\")\r\n    34\t    ap.add_argument(\"--out\", required=True, help=\"output CSV\")\r\n    35\t    args = ap.parse_args(argv)\r\n    36\t    run(args.stations, args.data, args.out)\r\n    37\t    return 0\r\n    38\t\r\n    39\t\r\n    40\tif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    41\t    sys.exit(main())\r\n"]
[30.936691, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[30.936708, "o", "root@95685272-3c41-4761-b59a-814390f96fd6:/app# "]
[36.608909, "i", "printf '%s\\n' '--- meta.py ---'; cat et0/meta.py; printf '%s\\n' '--- ingest.py ---'; cat et0/ingest.py\n"]
[36.609236, "o", "printf '%s\\n' '--- meta.py ---'; cat et0/meta.py; printf '%s\\n' '--- ingest.py ---'; cat et0/ingest.py\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[36.609279, "o", "--- meta.py ---\r\n"]
[36.610526, "o", "\"\"\"Station register: read the stations YAML into Station records (fields are described in /app/docs/METHOD.md).\"\"\"\r\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\r\n\r\nimport yaml\r\n\r\n\r\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\r\nclass Station:\r\n    station_id: str\r\n    name: str\r\n    latitude: float          # decimal degrees, north positive\r\n    longitude: float\r\n    elevation_m: float\r\n    wind_height_m: float\r\n    radiation_units: str\r\n    humidity: str\r\n    network: str\r\n\r\n\r\ndef parse_latitude(value):\r\n    \"\"\"Latitude in decimal degrees.\r\n\r\n    The register holds plain numbers (38.42, -31.85) and, for stations imported from the synop and coast networks,\r\n    text with a hemisphere letter (\"36.95N\").\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    if isinstance(value, (int, float)):\r\n        return float(value)\r\n    text = str(value).strip().upper()\r\n    return float(text.rstrip(\"NS\"))\r\n\r\n\r\ndef load_stations(path):\r\n    with open(path, encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\r\n        doc = yaml.safe_load(f)\r\n    stations = []\r\n    for rec in doc[\"stations\"]:\r\n        stations.append(Stati"]
[36.610553, "o", "on(\r\n            station_id=str(rec[\"id\"]),\r\n            name=str(rec.get(\"name\", \"\")),\r\n            latitude=parse_latitude(rec[\"latitude\"]),\r\n            longitude=float(rec[\"longitude\"]),\r\n            elevation_m=float(rec[\"elevation_m\"]),\r\n            wind_height_m=float(rec[\"wind_height_m\"]),\r\n            radiation_units=str(rec[\"radiation_units\"]),\r\n            humidity=str(rec[\"humidity\"]),\r\n            network=str(rec.get(\"network\", \"\")),\r\n        ))\r\n    return stations\r\n"]
[36.610699, "o", "--- ingest.py ---\r\n"]
[36.611827, "o", "\"\"\"Read one station's raw daily file and turn it into the standard daily inputs used by fao56.et0_daily.\"\"\"\r\nimport os\r\n\r\nimport pandas as pd\r\n\r\nfrom . import fao56\r\n\r\nBASE_COLUMNS = [\"date\", \"tmax_c\", \"tmin_c\", \"wind_ms\", \"solar_rad\"]\r\nHUMIDITY_COLUMNS = {\"rh_minmax\": [\"rh_max_pct\", \"rh_min_pct\"], \"dewpoint\": [\"tdew_c\"]}\r\n\r\n\r\ndef load_station(station, data_dir):\r\n    \"\"\"Return a DataFrame with columns station_id, date, doy, tmax, tmin, ea, u2, rs (standard units).\"\"\"\r\n    path = os.path.join(data_dir, f\"{station.station_id}.csv\")\r\n    raw = pd.read_csv(path)\r\n    if station.humidity not in HUMIDITY_COLUMNS:\r\n        raise ValueError(f\"{station.station_id}: unknown humidity type {station.humidity!r}\")\r\n    missing = [c for c in BASE_COLUMNS + HUMIDITY_COLUMNS[station.humidity] if c not in raw.columns]\r\n    if missing:\r\n        raise ValueError(f\"{path}: missing columns {missing}\")\r\n\r\n    dates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"date\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\r\n    df = pd.DataFrame({\r\n        \"station_id\": station.station_id,\r"]
[36.611851, "o", "\n        \"date\": dates.dt.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\r\n        \"doy\": dates.dt.dayofyear.astype(int),\r\n        \"tmax\": raw[\"tmax_c\"].astype(float),\r\n        \"tmin\": raw[\"tmin_c\"].astype(float),\r\n    })\r\n    if station.humidity == \"dewpoint\":\r\n        df[\"ea\"] = fao56.actual_vapour_pressure_dewpoint(raw[\"tdew_c\"].astype(float))\r\n    else:\r\n        df[\"ea\"] = fao56.actual_vapour_pressure_rh(df[\"tmax\"], df[\"tmin\"], raw[\"rh_max_pct\"].astype(float),\r\n                                                   raw[\"rh_min_pct\"].astype(float))\r\n    df[\"u2\"] = raw[\"wind_ms\"].astype(float)          # m/s at 2 m\r\n    df[\"rs\"] = raw[\"solar_rad\"].astype(float)        # MJ m-2 day-1\r\n    return df\r\n"]
